        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Wain, Ödön von Horváth\n- Roles: poet, novelist, critic, playwright\n- Organizations: The Movement\n- Places: Sušak, Rijeka, Austria–Hungary, Croatia, Paris\n\nFacts:\n- John Wain was born on 14 March 1925 and died on 24 May 1994.\n- Ödön von Horváth, born Edmund Josef von Horváth, was born on 9 December 1901 in Sušak, Rijeka, then in Austria–Hungary and now in Croatia, and he died on 1 June 1938 in Paris.\n- John Wain was an English poet, novelist, and critic associated with the literary group The Movement.\n- Ödön von Horváth was a German-writing playwright and novelist of Austro-Hungarian birth.",
